---
layout: layouts/main.njk
permalink: /index.html
pageClass: index
---

<div class="home">
  <section class="home__hero">
    <div class="home__intro">
      <p class="kicker">Una recomendación musical diaria</p>
      <h1 class="display home__title">Una canción al día.<br>Durante <mark>ocho años.</mark></h1>
      <p class="home__lead">Entre 2009 y 2017, un grupo de amigos escribimos casi 2.000 recomendaciones y grabamos
        335 programas con <a href="https://uniradio.ujaen.es/" target="_blank">UniRadio Jaén</a>. Aquí siguen todas, con su reproductor.</p>
      <p class="home__actions">
        <a class="button button--accent" href="/radio/"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 4l14 8-14 8z"/></svg>Escuchar la radio</a>
        <a class="button" href="/archive/"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h10"/></svg>Explorar el archivo</a>
        <a class="button" href="/rand/"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="3"/><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="1.3" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="16" cy="16" r="1.3" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.3" fill="currentColor"/></svg>Al azar</a>
      </p>

      {#- In the hero's left column: it fills the room beside the long "Tal día como hoy" card. No "8 años":
          the title already says it #}
      <section class="home__figures" aria-label="dSong en cifras">
        {%- for figure in [
          [stats.totals.posts, "artículos", "/archive/all/"],
          [stats.totals.podcasts, "podcasts", "/archive/podcasts/"],
          [stats.totals.artists, "artistas", "/archive/artists/"],
          [stats.totals.editors, "autores", "/archive/editors/"]
        ] %}
        <a class="home__figure" href="{{ figure[2] }}"><span class="display home__figure-value">{{ figure[0] | thousands }}</span><span class="kicker">{{ figure[1] }}</span></a>
        {%- endfor %}
      </section>
    </div>

    {#- Filled by js/on-this-day.js with the visitor's date (the site is static) #}
    <aside class="on-this-day" aria-labelledby="on-this-day-title" hidden>
      <div class="on-this-day__header">
        <h2 class="kicker" id="on-this-day-title">Tal día como hoy</h2>
        <span class="display on-this-day__date"><span class="on-this-day__day"></span> <span class="on-this-day__month"></span></span>
      </div>
      <p class="on-this-day__note" hidden></p>
      <ol class="on-this-day__list"></ol>
      <section class="on-this-day__anniversaries-box" hidden>
        <h3 class="kicker on-this-day__subhead"></h3>
        <ol class="on-this-day__anniversaries"></ol>
        <p class="on-this-day__source">Años que cumple cada disco hoy, según MusicBrainz.</p>
      </section>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <section class="home__ways">
    <h2 class="display home__ways-title">Cuatro formas de perderse</h2>
    <div class="home__ways-cards">
      <a class="way-card" href="/radio/">
        <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="8" width="18" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M7 4l10 4"/><circle cx="15" cy="14" r="3"/><path d="M6 12h4M6 15h4"/></svg>
        <span class="display way-card__title">Radio</span>
        <span>Un artículo tras otro, sin recargar. En orden o al azar.</span>
      </a>
      <a class="way-card" href="/archive/">
        <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h10"/></svg>
        <span class="display way-card__title">Archivo</span>
        <span>Todo en una tabla: por año, artista, álbum, autor o país.</span>
      </a>
      <a class="way-card" href="/mapa/">
        <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3c3 3 3 15 0 18M12 3c-3 3-3 15 0 18"/></svg>
        <span class="display way-card__title">Mapa</span>
        <span>El mundo coloreado por la nacionalidad de los artistas.</span>
      </a>
      <a class="way-card way-card--accent" href="/archive/podcasts/">
        <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="3" width="6" height="11" rx="3"/><path d="M5 11a7 7 0 0014 0M12 18v3"/></svg>
        <span class="display way-card__title">Podcast</span>
        <span>{{ stats.totals.podcasts }} programas en UniRadio Jaén. Suscríbete por RSS.</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
<script src="/js/on-this-day.js?v={{ 'js/on-this-day.js' | assetVersion }}" defer></script>
